<div class="space-y-6 font-body text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-oxygen/85 md:text-lg">
	<div class="space-y-3">
		<h3 class="font-700 text-oxygen">Volunteers Make All the Difference</h3>
		<p>
			Volunteers are the face and driving force of intoTRI. With roles from setup (day before) to registration, swim/bike/run marshal, transition zone and finish line, there is something for everyone.
			Most roles don’t require any prior knowledge – just a smile on your face and enthusiasm to help out. Minimum Age: 13y+ (a limited number of roles may be suitable for younger children).
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="space-y-3">
		<h3 class="font-700 text-oxygen">Rewards:</h3>
		<p><strong>Friends / Family Volunteering = </strong><span class="text-volt font-700">50% OFF</span></p>
		<p>
			Everyone bringing a volunteer along for a Cornish Tri & Mini Tri event they participate in will receive a 50% credit on the price paid for a junior entry (junior event volunteers) or senior sprint entry (all senior event volunteers).
			The credit is added to the wallet in your intoTRI user account 3 days after the event. Wallet funds can be used towards any future event entries or merchandise on intotri.com.
		</p><br>
		<p><strong>Volunteer yourself = </strong><span class="text-volt font-700">100% OFF</span></p>
		<p>
			Everyone volunteering at a junior or senior event will receive a <strong>100% credit</strong> on the entry fee for the type of race they volunteered at (ex parking / event shirt surcharge if applicable. All senior event volunteering credits based on sprint event entry). The credit is added to the wallet in your intoTRI user account 3 days after the event.
			Wallet funds can be used towards any future event entries or merchandise on intotri.com.
		</p><br>
		<p><strong>Volunteer for a club or school = </strong><span class="text-volt font-700">££ Donation </span></p>
		<p>
			If you are part of a club/school or community group supplying multiple volunteers for an event, you can use your volunteering activity to raise funds for your group.
			intoTRI makes a <strong>donation to the group for each volunteer</strong> who does not wish to receive a credit for future events.
			Donations are processed via bank transfer 3 days after the event.
		</p>
	</div>
</div>
